// hooks/
// This directory will contain custom React hooks that encapsulate reusable stateful logic.
// Examples:
//   - useAuth()         → access current user, login, logout
//   - useStudents()     → fetch and cache student list via React Query
//   - useAttendance()   → fetch and mutate attendance records
//   - useDebounce()     → debounce search input values
//   - usePagination()   → manage page/pageSize state for tables
